# plasma6-wallpapers-komplex
## [1.0.6] - 2025-09-21
### Added
- QML Scene support
- GeometryProvider for 3D Model importing (obj/stl)
- Pexels Image importing for channels
- Pexels Video importing for channels
- ShaderToy importer
### Changed
### Fixed
- Bug introduced by frame limiting attempt that broke video playback
### Removed
- Backend support for frame limiting (temporary)